19. Contamination / Poisoning Protection

CNS must prevent:

BAD SOURCE
 ↓
AI SUMMARY
 ↓
MEMORY
 ↓
ANOTHER AI SUMMARY
 ↓
SECOND MEMORY
 ↓
"CORROBORATION"

That is fake evidence multiplication.

Therefore:

provenance is transitive

source fingerprints are retained

shared upstream sources are visible

suspicious sources can be quarantined

derived knowledge retains dependencies

contaminated knowledge can trigger downstream invalidation

repetition alone never creates authority



