26. Failure and Recovery

Failure	Required response

Duplicate	Identity + idempotency + link/merge
Stale	Temporal/freshness validation
False corroboration	Source-lineage analysis
Hidden contradiction	Contradiction scan
Poisoned source	Quarantine + dependency invalidation
Wrong lesson	Outcome attribution
Concurrent conflict	Version check + explicit conflict
Crash during write	Replay durable event
Index failure	Rebuild/fallback
Historical leakage	Reject snapshot + record incident
Corrupt summary	Rebuild from evidence



